<?xml version="1.0"?>
<config xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="urn:magento:module:Magento_Config:etc/system_file.xsd">
    <system>
        <section id="payment">
            <group id="paradoxlabs_cybersource" translate="label comment" type="text" sortOrder="33" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1">
                <label>CyberSource</label>
                <frontend_model>ParadoxLabs\TokenBase\Block\Adminhtml\Config\FilterComment</frontend_model>
                <comment><![CDATA[
                    <div class="paradoxlabs-module-header">
                        <a class="logo" href="https://support.paradoxlabs.com/" target="_blank"><img src="{{view url=ParadoxLabs_TokenBase::images/paradoxlabs-logo.svg}}" width="171" height="50" alt="ParadoxLabs, inc."></a>
                        <div class="messages message success">
                            {{trans 'Not seeing a feature or option you need?'}}
                            <a class="btn action-basic" href="https://paradoxlabs.com/contact/" target="_blank">Request a Feature</a>
                        </div>
                        <div class="actions">
                            <a class="btn action-default" href="https://paradoxlabs.com/media/wysiwyg/ParadoxLabs-CyberSource-M2-user-manual.pdf" target="_blank">📋 {{trans 'User Manual'}}</a>
                            <a class="btn action-default" href="https://support.paradoxlabs.com/" target="_blank">❓ {{trans 'Get Support'}}</a>
                        </div>
                        <div class="partner">
                            <img src="{{view url=ParadoxLabs_CyberSource::images/logo.webp}}" width="140" height="34" border="0" alt="{{trans 'CyberSource Payment Solutions'}}">
                        </div>
                    </div>
                ]]></comment>
                <field id="version" translate="label" type="label" sortOrder="0" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="0">
                    <label>Version Installed</label>
                    <backend_model>ParadoxLabs\CyberSource\Model\Config\Version</backend_model>
                </field>
                <field id="active" translate="label" type="select" sortOrder="10" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1">
                    <label>Enabled</label>
                    <source_model>Magento\Config\Model\Config\Source\Yesno</source_model>
                </field>
                <field id="test" translate="label" type="select" sortOrder="20" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="0">
                    <label>Is Sandbox Account</label>
                    <source_model>Magento\Config\Model\Config\Source\Yesno</source_model>
                </field>
                <field id="title" translate="label" type="text" sortOrder="30" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1">
                    <label>Title</label>
                </field>
                <field id="heading_rest" translate="label" sortOrder="140" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="0">
                    <label>REST API Setup</label>
                    <frontend_model>ParadoxLabs\CyberSource\Block\Adminhtml\Config\DescriptiveHeader</frontend_model>
                    <attribute type="shared">1</attribute>
                    <comment><![CDATA[
                        The REST API is used for all payment processing, Unified Checkout, and card/transaction
                        updates (via Account Updater and Decision Manager). These keys are required.
                    ]]></comment>
                </field>
                <field id="apitest_rest" translate="label" type="label" sortOrder="150" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="0">
                    <label>API Test Results</label>
                    <frontend_model>ParadoxLabs\CyberSource\Block\Adminhtml\Config\ApiTest\Rest</frontend_model>
                </field>
                <field id="merchant_id" translate="label" type="text" sortOrder="154" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="0">
                    <label>Merchant ID</label>
                </field>
                <field id="rest_secret_key_id" translate="label" type="text" sortOrder="160" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="0">
                    <label>REST API Secret Key ID</label>
                </field>
                <field id="rest_secret_key" translate="label" type="obscure" sortOrder="170" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="0">
                    <label>REST API Secret Key</label>
                    <backend_model>Magento\Config\Model\Config\Backend\Encrypted</backend_model>
                </field>
                <field id="heading_unified_checkout" translate="label" sortOrder="180" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="0">
                    <label>Unified Checkout Setup</label>
                    <frontend_model>ParadoxLabs\CyberSource\Block\Adminhtml\Config\DescriptiveHeader</frontend_model>
                    <attribute type="shared">1</attribute>
                    <comment><![CDATA[
                        All credit card forms use the CyberSource Unified Checkout drop-in (UC.js), authenticated
                        with the REST API keys above. Digital wallets and Payer Authentication require enablement
                        on your CyberSource merchant account before turning them on here.
                    ]]></comment>
                </field>
                <field id="uc_3ds" translate="label comment" type="select" sortOrder="190" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1" canRestore="1">
                    <label>Enable Payer Authentication (3D Secure)</label>
                    <source_model>Magento\Config\Model\Config\Source\Yesno</source_model>
                    <comment>If yes, 3D Secure authentication will run inside the Unified Checkout payment form. Requires Payer Authentication setup by CyberSource support.</comment>
                </field>
                <field id="uc_decision_manager" translate="label comment" type="select" sortOrder="200" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1" canRestore="1">
                    <label>Enable Decision Manager</label>
                    <source_model>Magento\Config\Model\Config\Source\Yesno</source_model>
                    <comment>If yes, Decision Manager fraud screening will be requested on Unified Checkout transactions. Requires Decision Manager on your CyberSource merchant account.</comment>
                </field>
                <field id="organization_id" translate="label comment" type="text" sortOrder="205" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="0">
                    <label>Decision Manager Organization ID</label>
                    <comment>Used only to poll Decision Manager for review decisions. This is not an API credential; leave it empty unless CyberSource gave you an organization ID distinct from your merchant ID.</comment>
                    <depends>
                        <field id="uc_decision_manager">1</field>
                    </depends>
                </field>
                <field id="uc_allowed_payment_types" translate="label comment" type="multiselect" sortOrder="210" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1" canRestore="1">
                    <label>Allowed Payment Types</label>
                    <options>
                        <option label="Card Entry">PANENTRY</option>
                        <option label="Apple Pay">APPLEPAY</option>
                        <option label="Google Pay">GOOGLEPAY</option>
                        <option label="Click to Pay">CLICKTOPAY</option>
                        <option label="Paze">PAZE</option>
                    </options>
                    <validate>required-entry</validate>
                    <comment>Payment methods offered within the Unified Checkout form. Digital wallets must be enabled on your CyberSource merchant account first.</comment>
                </field>
                <field id="uc_allowed_card_networks" translate="label comment" type="multiselect" sortOrder="220" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1" canRestore="1">
                    <label>Allowed Card Networks</label>
                    <options>
                        <option label="Visa">VISA</option>
                        <option label="Mastercard">MASTERCARD</option>
                        <option label="American Express">AMEX</option>
                        <option label="Discover">DISCOVER</option>
                        <option label="Diners Club">DINERSCLUB</option>
                        <option label="JCB">JCB</option>
                        <option label="Maestro">MAESTRO</option>
                        <option label="China UnionPay">CUP</option>
                        <option label="Cartes Bancaires">CARTESBANCAIRES</option>
                    </options>
                    <validate>required-entry</validate>
                    <comment>Card networks accepted by the Unified Checkout form. Only select networks your merchant account supports.</comment>
                </field>
                <field id="uc_billing_type" translate="label comment" type="select" sortOrder="230" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1" canRestore="1">
                    <label>Collect Billing Address</label>
                    <options>
                        <option label="Full Address">FULL</option>
                        <option label="Partial (Postal Code Only)">PARTIAL</option>
                        <option label="None">NONE</option>
                    </options>
                    <comment>How much billing address information the Unified Checkout form collects from the customer. Checkout already collects a billing address, which is sent with the transaction; None is recommended.</comment>
                </field>
                <field id="uc_country" translate="label comment" type="select" sortOrder="232" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1" canRestore="1">
                    <label>Merchant Country</label>
                    <source_model>Magento\Directory\Model\Config\Source\Country</source_model>
                    <comment>Country passed to Unified Checkout. Leave empty to use the store's default country.</comment>
                </field>
                <field id="uc_locale" translate="label comment" type="text" sortOrder="234" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1" canRestore="1">
                    <label>Form Locale</label>
                    <comment>Locale code for the Unified Checkout form, e.g. en_US. Leave empty to use the store locale.</comment>
                </field>
                <field id="uc_target_origins" translate="label comment" type="text" sortOrder="236" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1">
                    <label>Additional Target Origins</label>
                    <comment>The current store/admin origin is included automatically. Use this to add extra exact HTTPS origins (e.g. https://www.example.com) allowed to load the Unified Checkout form, such as headless storefront domains. Comma-separated.</comment>
                </field>
                <field id="uc_client_version" translate="label comment" type="text" sortOrder="238" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="0" showInStore="0" canRestore="1">
                    <label>UC.js Client Version</label>
                    <comment>Pinned Unified Checkout client library version. Do not change unless directed by ParadoxLabs support.</comment>
                </field>
                <field id="heading_checkout" translate="label" sortOrder="240" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="0">
                    <label>Checkout Settings</label>
                    <frontend_model>Magento\Config\Block\System\Config\Form\Field\Heading</frontend_model>
                    <attribute type="shared">1</attribute>
                </field>
                <field id="payment_action" translate="label comment" type="select" sortOrder="250" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="0" canRestore="1">
                    <label>Payment Action</label>
                    <source_model>ParadoxLabs\TokenBase\Model\Source\PaymentAction</source_model>
                    <attribute type="shared">1</attribute>
                    <comment>'Authorize and Capture' to charge on checkout. Note 'Save Info' does not support Payer Authentication.</comment>
                </field>
                <field id="uc_auto_place_order" translate="label comment" type="select" sortOrder="255" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1" canRestore="1">
                    <label>Place Order Automatically After Card Entry</label>
                    <source_model>Magento\Config\Model\Config\Source\Yesno</source_model>
                    <comment>If yes, completing card entry (or a wallet confirmation) in the payment form places the order immediately, with no separate Place Order click. Terms and conditions and other checkout validations still apply; if any fail, the order is not placed and the customer uses the normal Place Order button.</comment>
                </field>
                <field id="uc_review_step" translate="label comment" type="select" sortOrder="256" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1" canRestore="1">
                    <label>Show Payment Review</label>
                    <source_model>Magento\Config\Model\Config\Source\Yesno</source_model>
                    <comment>If yes, CyberSource shows its own review screen after card entry, before handing back to checkout. Off by default. Turn it on if you want the final click labeled 'Pay' or 'Confirm and Continue', rather than 'Continue'.</comment>
                </field>
                <field id="order_status" translate="label comment" type="select" sortOrder="260" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="0" canRestore="1">
                    <label>New Order Status</label>
                    <source_model>ParadoxLabs\TokenBase\Model\Source\OrderStatus</source_model>
                    <comment>Normally 'Pending' if 'Authorize Only' above; 'Processing' if not.</comment>
                </field>
                <field id="show_branding" translate="label comment" type="select" sortOrder="270" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1" canRestore="1">
                    <label>Show CyberSource logo</label>
                    <source_model>Magento\Config\Model\Config\Source\Yesno</source_model>
                    <comment>Show a CyberSource logo on the payment form.</comment>
                </field>
                <field id="allowspecific" translate="label" type="allowspecific" sortOrder="280" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1" canRestore="1">
                    <label>Allow for Countries</label>
                    <source_model>Magento\Payment\Model\Config\Source\Allspecificcountries</source_model>
                </field>
                <field id="specificcountry" translate="label" type="multiselect" sortOrder="290" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1" canRestore="1">
                    <label>Allow for Specific Countries</label>
                    <source_model>Magento\Directory\Model\Config\Source\Country</source_model>
                    <can_be_empty>1</can_be_empty>
                    <depends>
                        <field id="allowspecific">1</field>
                    </depends>
                </field>
                <field id="min_order_total" translate="label" type="text" sortOrder="300" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1" canRestore="1">
                    <label>Minimum Order Total</label>
                </field>
                <field id="max_order_total" translate="label" type="text" sortOrder="310" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1" canRestore="1">
                    <label>Maximum Order Total</label>
                </field>
                <field id="sort_order" translate="label" type="text" sortOrder="320" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1" canRestore="1">
                    <label>Sort Order</label>
                    <frontend_class>validate-number</frontend_class>
                </field>
                <field id="heading_advanced" translate="label" sortOrder="330" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="0">
                    <label>Advanced Settings</label>
                    <frontend_model>Magento\Config\Block\System\Config\Form\Field\Heading</frontend_model>
                    <attribute type="shared">1</attribute>
                </field>
                <field id="allow_unsaved" translate="label comment" type="select" sortOrder="340" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="0" canRestore="1">
                    <label>Allow cards to not be stored</label>
                    <source_model>Magento\Config\Model\Config\Source\Yesno</source_model>
                    <comment>If yes, customers can choose whether to save their credit card during checkout.</comment>
                </field>
                <field id="savecard_opt_out" translate="label comment" type="select" sortOrder="350" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="0" canRestore="1">
                    <label>Auto-select 'save for next time'</label>
                    <source_model>Magento\Config\Model\Config\Source\Yesno</source_model>
                    <comment>If yes, will be selected by default during checkout.</comment>
                    <depends>
                        <field id="allow_unsaved">1</field>
                    </depends>
                </field>
                <field id="require_ccv" translate="label comment" type="select" sortOrder="360" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="0" canRestore="1">
                    <label>Require CVN for stored cards</label>
                    <source_model>Magento\Config\Model\Config\Source\Yesno</source_model>
                    <comment>If yes, CVN will be required for stored cards, and customers may have to enter it twice on checkout. This will not affect recurring transactions.</comment>
                </field>
                <field id="reauthorize_partial_invoice" translate="label comment" type="select" sortOrder="370" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="0" canRestore="1">
                    <label>Reauthorize on Partial Invoice</label>
                    <source_model>Magento\Config\Model\Config\Source\Yesno</source_model>
                    <comment>If yes, when you create a partial invoice, we will reauthorize any outstanding balance on the order. This helps guarantee funds, but can cause multiple holds on the card until transactions settle.</comment>
                </field>
                <field id="fingerprint" translate="label" type="select" sortOrder="380" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1" canRestore="1">
                    <label>Enable Device Fingerprinting</label>
                    <source_model>Magento\Config\Model\Config\Source\Yesno</source_model>
                    <comment>Used by Decision Manager and Fraud Management Essentials to identify users for better fraud prevention.</comment>
                </field>
                <field id="fingerprint_domain" translate="label" type="text" sortOrder="390" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="0" canRestore="1">
                    <label>Enhanced Profiling Domain</label>
                    <comment>If you've set up an 'Enhanced Profiling' custom domain with CyberSource, enter it here. Do not change this setting until the DNS and SSL are fully tested. See Decision Manager documentation for instructions.</comment>
                    <depends>
                        <field id="fingerprint">1</field>
                    </depends>
                </field>
            </group>
        </section>
    </system>
</config>
